    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51026" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοδύ̆νᾰμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equal in force</i> or
				<i>power</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1.135
			</span></i>; of drugs, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				2.30
			</span></i>; <i>equivalent in meaning</i>, Men.Prot.<i><span class="en">
				p.24D.
			</span></i>: generally, <i>equivalent</i>, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ma.</u>
				3.15
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
